# Testing

- Prefer vertical-slice tests when implementing features (failing test → implementation → refactor).
- Cover entitlement display edges: unpaid badge still allows listed actions; missing grant empty states.
- Prefer testing modules through their public interface (API mappers, date/timezone helpers).
- Do not add flaky UI-only tests that assert CSS class names.
- When app scaffold exists, document the test runner in `docs/architecture.md`.
